menu "SlimeVR BLE receiver"

config SLIME_XIAO_C6_ANTENNA
    bool "Seeed XIAO ESP32-C6: RF switch (onboard / U.FL antenna)"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
    help
        The XIAO ESP32-C6 routes its radio through an RF switch: GPIO3 low powers it, GPIO14 picks
        the antenna (low: the onboard ceramic one, high: the U.FL connector). Without this the
        radio stays on the onboard antenna whatever is plugged in. The receiver starts on the U.FL
        antenna; console N 0 / N 1 switches (main.c).

endmenu
